# Licensed BADA 4 TO bank/load ABORT gate.
# Run only after pybada-envelope-terminal passes.
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === PYBADATEM TAKEOFF LATERAL ABORT GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST EXPECT TOA remains TO with HLid 3, gear up, nf3/nf1, and bank maximum near 60 degrees.
00:00:00.10>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.15>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.20>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:01.00>CRE TOA,A320-232,41.300,2.100,90,200,140
00:00:01.10>DYNAMICS TOA KINEMATIC
00:00:01.20>BADACONFIG TOA PYBADA
00:00:01.30>ALT TOA 5000 1500
00:00:01.40>BANK TOA 70
00:00:01.50>ENVELOPECHECKS TOA CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPE TOA ABORT
00:00:01.70>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada-envelope-takeoff-abort.csv
00:00:01.80>PERFSTATUS TOA BOUNDS
00:00:02.00>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding a turn with 70 degrees. Expect one BANK_ANGLE,LOAD_FACTOR ABORTED event followed by HOLD.
00:00:02.10>HDG TOA 270
